  {
   "id": "preserve-261574@major-2024-12-12",
   "gameId": "preserve-261574",
   "displayName": "New update: Leaderboards are here, Preservers!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-12T13:04:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It’s time to see how your preservation skills measure up!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As teased in our previous announcement, Preserve is getting Leaderboards!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s what you can look forward to",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Biomes and Map Sizes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Leaderboards will be divided by biomes and map sizes, so you can dominate your favorite areas and see how you stack up against others.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fair Play Competition",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prove your preserving prowess and climb the ranks—this is your moment to shine!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "A few things to note",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. The current chart features scores from our testers and developers. These are placeholders and will be cleared before the update officially launches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. When Preserve hits its 1.0 launch, all leaderboard scores will be reset to ensure a level playing field. Don’t worry—your progress and achievements are here to stay!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ready to claim the preserving throne and secure the top spot?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned—more updates are on the horizon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy preserving (and climbing to the top)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
